        "Counting statistics are the official euroleague.net box score, not recounted from events.",
        "points_per_100_team_possessions uses the TEAM's possessions while this player's team had the ball, not the player's own usage. It is a rate, not a usage measure.",
        "true_shooting_pct = points / [2 x (FGA + 0.44 x FTA)]. The 0.44 free-throw factor is the standard estimate, not an event-exact scoring denominator.",
        "usage_event_rate = (FGA events + inferred free-throw trips + turnover events) / exact offensive possessions with the player in the possession-start lineup. It is a custom event rate, not standard USG%; and-one trips are included and the rate can exceed 100%.",
